@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LifeSmart - Hệ sinh thái Kế hoạch & Dinh dưỡng Chuẩn Y khoa</title>
    <!-- Font chữ hiện đại & Chart.js -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
            :root {
                --etm-orange: #f2613b;
                --etm-orange-hover: #d94f2b;
                --etm-teal: #00a896;
                --etm-purple: #9067c6;
                --etm-yellow: #f4a261;
                --dark: #0f172a;
                --gray: #64748b;
                --light-bg: #f8fafc;
                --border: #e2e8f0;
                --primary: #10b981;
                --primary-dark: #059669;
                --primary-light: #ecfdf5;
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
            }

            body {
                background: #f8fafc;
                color: var(--dark);
                height: 100vh;
                overflow: hidden;
                display: flex;
            }

            .app-overlay {
                display: flex;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
            }

            /* 1. SIDEBAR */
            .sidebar {
                width: 260px;
                background: #ffffff;
                border-right: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                z-index: 10;
            }

            .sidebar-brand {
                padding: 20px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;
                font-size: 1.4rem;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--etm-orange);
                border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            }

                .sidebar-brand span {
                    color: var(--primary);
                }

            .btn-vip-banner {
                margin: 14px 14px 8px 14px;
                padding: 11px 16px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2613b 0%, #ea580c 100%);
                color: #fff;
                font-weight: 800;
                font-size: 0.88rem;
                border: none;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 8px;
                cursor: pointer;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(242, 97, 59, 0.3);
                transition: all 0.2s;
            }

                .btn-vip-banner:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-1px);
                }

            .menu {
                list-style: none;
                padding: 0 10px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 3px;
                overflow-y: auto;
            }

            .menu-heading {
                font-size: 0.72rem;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #94a3b8;
                letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                padding: 12px 14px 4px 14px;
            }

            .menu li a {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
                padding: 10px 14px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                text-decoration: none;
                color: var(--gray);
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                transition: all 0.2s;
            }

                .menu li a:hover {
                    background: #f1f5f9;
                    color: var(--dark);
                }

                .menu li a.active {
                    background: #e0f2fe;
                    color: #0284c7;
                    font-weight: 700;
                }

            /* 2. MAIN WORKSPACE */
            .main-content {
                flex: 1;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                overflow-y: auto;
                position: relative;
            }

            .header {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
                backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
                padding: 14px 32px;
                border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                position: sticky;
                top: 0;
                z-index: 10;
            }

            .user-avatar {
                width: 38px;
                height: 38px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
                color: #fff;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                font-weight: 800;
                font-size: 1rem;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

            .btn-logout-header {
                background: #fee2e2;
                color: #dc2626;
                border: 1px solid #fecaca;
                padding: 7px 13px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 0.82rem;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: all 0.2s;
            }

                .btn-logout-header:hover {
                    background: #dc2626;
                    color: #fff;
                }

            .view-container {
                padding: 24px 32px;
                max-width: 1400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                width: 100%;
            }

            /* HERO CARD & PROOF SHOWCASE (LANDING) */
            .hero-banner {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
                border-radius: 18px;
                padding: 32px 36px;
                color: #ffffff;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                margin-bottom: 24px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
            }

            .hero-banner-content {
                max-width: 65%;
            }

                .hero-banner-content h1 {
                    font-size: 1.65rem;
                    font-weight: 800;
                    margin: 12px 0 8px 0;
                }

                .hero-banner-content p {
                    font-size: 0.92rem;
                    color: #94a3b8;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                }

            .badge-pill {
                background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
                color: #34d399;
                border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
                padding: 5px 12px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                font-size: 0.78rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
            }

            .proof-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 20px;
                margin-bottom: 24px;
            }

            .proof-box {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 14px;
                padding: 20px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
            }

            .proof-box-icon {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }

            .bg-orange {
                background: #ffedd5;
                color: #ea580c;
            }

            .bg-blue {
                background: #e0f2fe;
                color: #0284c7;
            }

            .bg-cyan {
                background: #cffafe;
                color: #0891b2;
            }

            .bg-purple {
                background: #f3e8ff;
                color: #9333ea;
            }

            .proof-box h4 {
                font-size: 0.98rem;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--dark);
                margin-bottom: 6px;
            }

            .proof-box p {
                font-size: 0.84rem;
                color: var(--gray);
                line-height: 1.5;
                flex: 1;
            }

            .proof-badge {
                margin-top: 12px;
                font-size: 0.78rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--primary);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
            }

            /* ETM LAYOUT */
            .date-navigator-bar {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .date-control {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
                font-size: 1.3rem;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--dark);
            }

            .date-nav-btn {
                background: #fff;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 8px;
                width: 36px;
                height: 36px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                font-weight: 800;
                transition: all 0.2s;
            }

                .date-nav-btn:hover {
                    background: #f1f5f9;
                }

            .etm-split-layout {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
                gap: 24px;
            }

            .meals-column {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 18px;
            }

            .meal-group-card {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 14px;
                padding: 18px;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
            }

            .meal-group-header {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
                padding-bottom: 8px;
            }

            .meal-item-row {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                padding: 11px 14px;
                background: #f8fafc;
                border-radius: 10px;
                border: 1px solid var(--border);
                margin-bottom: 8px;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .macro-column {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 16px;
                padding: 24px;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
                height: fit-content;
            }

            .macro-pie-container {
                width: 210px;
                height: 210px;
                margin: 0 auto 16px auto;
                position: relative;
            }

            .btn {
                padding: 9px 16px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                border: none;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 0.88rem;
                cursor: pointer;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                transition: all 0.2s;
            }

            .btn-primary {
                background: var(--etm-teal);
                color: #fff;
            }

                .btn-primary:hover {
                    background: #008f80;
                }

            .btn-orange {
                background: var(--etm-orange);
                color: #fff;
            }

                .btn-orange:hover {
                    background: var(--etm-orange-hover);
                }

            .water-glass {
                transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
            }

                .water-glass.active {
                    opacity: 1 !important;
                    transform: scale(1.15);
                }

            /* MODALS */
            .modal-overlay {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
                backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
                display: none;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                z-index: 9999;
            }

            .modal-box {
                background: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 16px;
                width: 90%;
                max-width: 650px;
                padding: 26px;
                box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
                max-height: 88vh;
                overflow-y: auto;
            }

            .notification {
                position: fixed;
                bottom: 24px;
                right: 24px;
                background: var(--dark);
                color: #fff;
                padding: 12px 22px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                opacity: 0;
                transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
                z-index: 10000;
                box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            }

            /* FLOATING CHATBOT WIDGET */
            .chat-widget-btn {
                position: fixed;
                bottom: 26px;
                right: 26px;
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
                color: #fff;
                border: none;
                box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
                font-size: 1.7rem;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                z-index: 9998;
                transition: all 0.3s;
            }

                .chat-widget-btn:hover {
                    transform: scale(1.08) translateY(-3px);
                }

            .chat-window {
                position: fixed;
                bottom: 98px;
                right: 26px;
                width: 390px;
                height: 530px;
                background: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 18px;
                box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                display: none;
                flex-direction: column;
                z-index: 9998;
                overflow: hidden;
                animation: fadeInWidget 0.25s ease-out;
            }

            @@keyframes fadeInWidget {
                from {
                    opacity: 0;
                    transform: translateY(16px);
                }

                to {
                    opacity: 1;
                    transform: translateY(0);
                }
            }

            .chat-header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
                color: #fff;
                padding: 14px 18px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
            }

            .chat-body {
                flex: 1;
                padding: 16px;
                overflow-y: auto;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
                background: #f8fafc;
            }

            .chat-msg {
                max-width: 85%;
                padding: 10px 14px;
                border-radius: 13px;
                font-size: 0.88rem;
                line-height: 1.46;
                word-break: break-word;
            }

            .chat-msg-ai {
                background: #ffffff;
                color: var(--dark);
                border: 1px solid var(--border);
                align-self: flex-start;
                border-bottom-left-radius: 2px;
            }

            .chat-msg-user {
                background: #10b981;
                color: #ffffff;
                align-self: flex-end;
                border-bottom-right-radius: 2px;
            }

            .chat-footer {
                padding: 11px 13px;
                background: #ffffff;
                border-top: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                display: flex;
                gap: 8px;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .chat-input {
                flex: 1;
                padding: 10px 13px;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 9px;
                outline: none;
                font-size: 0.88rem;
            }

                .chat-input:focus {
                    border-color: #10b981;
                }

            .chat-send-btn {
                background: #10b981;
                color: #fff;
                border: none;
                border-radius: 9px;
                padding: 0 15px;
                height: 40px;
                font-weight: 700;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

                .chat-send-btn:hover {
                    background: #059669;
                }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="app-overlay">
        <!-- 1. SIDEBAR PHONG CÁCH EAT THIS MUCH -->
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-brand">
                🥕 Life<span>Smart</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Nút gói tài khoản -->
            <button class="btn-vip-banner" id="btnSidebarVip" onclick="openPricingModal()">
                ⭐ <span id="sidebarVipText">Tính năng Cao cấp (VIP)</span>
            </button>

            <ul class="menu">
                <div class="menu-heading">TỔNG QUAN</div>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="active" id="tab-nav-landing" onclick="switchEtmTab('landing')">
                        <span>🏠</span><span>Trang chủ & Giới thiệu</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-plan" onclick="switchEtmTab('plan')">
                        <span>📅</span><span>Kế hoạch (Plan)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-track" onclick="switchEtmTab('track')">
                        <span>🍴</span><span>Theo dõi (Track)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-statistics" onclick="switchEtmTab('statistics')">
                        <span>📊</span><span>Thống kê (Analytics)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-water" onclick="switchEtmTab('water')">
                        <span>💧</span><span>Uống nước (Hydration)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-sleep" onclick="switchEtmTab('sleep')">
                        <span>🌙</span><span>Giấc ngủ (Sleep AASM)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>

                <div class="menu-heading">TÀI KHOẢN & PHÂN QUYỀN</div>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="tab-nav-profile" onclick="switchEtmTab('profile')">
                        <span>👤</span><span>Hồ sơ & Thể trạng</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li id="menuAdminSection" style="display:none;">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="alert('Đang mở Bảng Quản trị Kho Dinh Dưỡng dành cho ADMIN!')">
                        <span>⚙️</span><span>Quản trị viên (Admin)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="toggleUserVipRole()">
                        <span>🔄</span><span id="txtToggleRole">Chuyển sang gói VIP (Demo)</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

        <!-- 2. MAIN WORKSPACE -->
        <main class="main-content">
            <header class="header">
                <div>
                    <h2 id="headerUserNameTitle" style="font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:800;">Xin chào, Dương Thu Hậu 👋</h2>
                    <small style="color:var(--gray);">Trợ lý Lập kế hoạch Thực đơn & Huấn luyện viên AI Cá nhân hóa</small>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
                    <span id="badgeUserRole" style="padding:5px 12px; border-radius:12px; font-weight:800; font-size:0.75rem; background:#fee2e2; color:#ef4444;">GÓI FREE</span>
                    <div class="user-avatar" id="headerAvatar" onclick="switchEtmTab('profile')">H</div>
                    <button class="btn-logout-header" onclick="handleLogout()" title="Đăng xuất / Đổi tài khoản">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-from-bracket"></i> Đăng xuất
                    </button>
                </div>
            </header>

            <div class="view-container">

                <!-- ================= TAB 0: TRANG CHỦ & LUẬN ĐIỂM KHOA HỌC ================= -->
                <div id="view-etm-landing">
                    <div class="hero-banner">
                        <div class="hero-banner-content">
                            <span class="badge-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Nền tảng Dinh Dưỡng Chuẩn Y Khoa & AI</span>
                            <h1>Quản Lý Lối Sống Thông Minh Cùng LifeSmart</h1>
                            <p>LifeSmart tích hợp toán học Mifflin-St Jeor, mô hình gợi ý thực đơn K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) và công nghệ Google Gemini AI để cá nhân hóa hoàn toàn lộ trình dinh dưỡng, lượng nước bù động và chu kỳ giấc ngủ sinh học.</p>
                            <div style="margin-top:20px; display:flex; gap:12px;">
                                <button class="btn btn-orange" onclick="switchEtmTab('plan')">📅 Khám phá Thực đơn Hôm nay</button>
                                <button class="btn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);" onclick="toggleChatWindow()">💬 Trò chuyện cùng AI</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
                            <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius:14px; padding:14px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse" style="font-size:24px; color:#f43f5e;"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff;">2.150 <small style="font-size:0.75rem;">kcal</small></div>
                                    <div style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#94a3b8;">Mục tiêu cân bằng TDEE</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius:14px; padding:14px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-dna" style="font-size:24px; color:#38bdf8;"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff;">99.1%</div>
                                    <div style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#94a3b8;">Khớp tỷ lệ Macro chuẩn</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:16px;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> Nền Tảng Khoa Học & Chuẩn Y Khoa
                    </h3>
                    <div class="proof-grid">
                        <!-- THẺ 1: BMR MIFFLIN-ST JEOR -->
                        <div class="proof-box">
                            <div class="proof-box-icon bg-orange"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire-burner"></i></div>
                            <h4>1. Năng Lượng Nền BMR & TDEE</h4>
                            <p>Ứng dụng công thức y học <strong>Mifflin-St Jeor (1990)</strong> được Hiệp hội Dinh dưỡng Hoa Kỳ công nhận là chuẩn xác nhất để tính toán mức tiêu hao calo sinh lý tự nhiên theo thể trạng.</p>
                            <div class="proof-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Bảo toàn khối cơ nạc & cân bằng trao đổi chất</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- THẺ 2: GIẤC NGỦ AASM -->
                        <div class="proof-box">
                            <div class="proof-box-icon bg-purple"><i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i></div>
                            <h4>2. Chu Kỳ Giấc Ngủ 90 Phút (AASM)</h4>
                            <p>Dựa trên chuẩn <strong>American Academy of Sleep Medicine</strong>, chia đều các chu kỳ 90 phút để đảm bảo thức giấc tại pha ngủ nông, giúp tinh thần sảng khoái và tối ưu phục hồi thể lực.</p>
